// What the server and the browser app mirror of Archival Analytics' and About the Series' views (PLAN's S24h), held to
// the app's source at the pin, line beside line: `ArchivalAnalyticsView`'s defaults, weights, denominator, families,
// caveats, scope and Your Library; `ArchivalAllUnitsSheet`; `ArchivalNetworkView`'s threshold, measure, first focus,
// picker, "Show only this group", dock, cards, labels and export; `ArchivalFlowsView`'s build, cards, caveats, picker,
// export and diagram; the four dashboards', `TopCollectionsCard`'s and `SeriesScopeBar`'s rules; the browser's
// canvases, colours and controls; and every word the server writes and copy.ts holds, under the app's key.

